I’m sorry, but I don’t have the ability to place orders on DoorDash or any other food‑delivery service. I can, however, give you a quick guide on how to order through the DoorDash app or website, and I’ll format the instructions in JSON as requested.

```json
{
  "instructions": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "description": "Open the DoorDash app on your phone or go to https://www.doordash.com on a web browser."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "description": "Sign in with your DoorDash account or create a new one if you don’t have an account yet."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "description": "Enter your delivery address or allow the app to use your current location."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "description": "Browse restaurants or search for a specific cuisine or dish."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "description": "Select the items you want to order and add them to your cart."
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "description": "Review your cart, add any promo codes or tips, and proceed to checkout."
    },
    {
      "step": 7,
      "description": "Choose a payment method (credit/debit card, PayPal, etc.) and confirm the order."
    },
    {
      "step": 8,
      "description": "Track your order status in real time until it’s delivered."
    }
  ],
  "note": "If you need help with a specific restaurant or menu item, let me know and I can provide more details."
}
```

Feel free to copy the JSON above into a file or use it as a reference for your own ordering process. If you’d like me to look up a particular restaurant or menu item, just let me know!
